<title>HONG KONG: SHK Convert plans HK$4/shr distribution.</title>
<headline>SHK Convert plans HK$4/shr distribution.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   12.74 vs 17.67</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil   vs 30.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil   vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    10.19 vs 14.13</p>
<p>    Turnover		     22.22 vs 21.40</p>
<p>    Company name		 SHK Convertibles Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - SHK Convertibles invests in convertible bonds.</p>
<p>The company proposed cash distribution of HK$4.0 per share, totalling HK$320 million, by way of reduction of share premium account, subject to shareholder approval.</p>
<p>The company said a further announcement will be made in respect of the date of an extraordinary general meeting and the date of the cash distribution entitlement and closure of register of members.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
